{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2022-01-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'CBRE EARNS PLACE IN BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX FOR THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CBRE GROUP, INC.'S CONTINUED FOCUS ON DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION EARNED THE COMPANY A PLACE IN THE 2022 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX (GEI) FOR THE THIRD YEAR IN A ROW. THE BLOOMBERG GEI BRINGS TRANSPARENCY TO GENDER-RELATED PRACTICES AND POLICIES AT PUBLICLY LISTED COMPANIES, INCREASING THE BREADTH OF ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, GOVERNANCE (ESG) DATA AVAILABLE TO INVESTORS. BLOOMBERG EVALUATES COMPANIES ACROSS FIVE PILLARS: FEMALE LEADERSHIP & TALENT PIPELINE, EQ"}